//! The `align-self` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property overrides a
//! grid or flex item's `align-items` value. In grid, it aligns the item inside the `grid area`. In
//! flexbox, it aligns the item on the `cross axis`.
//!
//! Initial: auto. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Grammar: auto | <overflow-position>? [ normal | <self-position> ]| stretch | <baseline-position>
//! | anchor-center
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-align-3/#propdef-align-self
//!
//! Author guide: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/align-self
//!
//! Purpose and value descriptions adapted from MDN contributors (CC-BY-SA-2.5).
//!
//! Generated from @webref/css 8.7.8. Do not edit.

